@startuml class-routine-C
' C안 — 루틴·공유·추천 로그의 도메인 클래스 다이어그램 (to-be). 회색 패키지 = 기존 테이블(backend/app/db.py 열 이름 그대로), 노란 = 신규 제안.
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide circle
hide empty methods

title C안 — 루틴 도메인 (to-be)과 기존 테이블의 연결

package "기존 테이블 (as-is)" #F2F2F2 {
  class user {
    id : INTEGER
    username : TEXT UNIQUE
    display_name : TEXT
    share_with_friends : INTEGER
  }
  class exercise {
    id : INTEGER
    name_ko : TEXT UNIQUE
    aliases : TEXT
    is_archived : INTEGER
  }
  class muscle_group {
    id : INTEGER
    code : TEXT UNIQUE
    level : INTEGER
    parent_id : INTEGER
  }
  class workout_session {
    id : INTEGER
    user_id : INTEGER
    date : TEXT
    {field} <color:#B8860B>routine_id : INTEGER NULL (열 추가)</color>
  }
  class friendship {
    requester_id : INTEGER
    addressee_id : INTEGER
    status : pending | accepted
  }
}

package "신규 (to-be)" #FFF9E6 {
  class routine #FFF2CC {
    id : INTEGER
    owner_id : INTEGER
    {field} name : TEXT ("4분할 루틴A")
    description : TEXT
    source : manual | ai | shared
    {field} origin_routine_id : INTEGER NULL (복사 원본)
    created_at, updated_at : TEXT
  }
  class routine_day #FFF2CC {
    id : INTEGER
    routine_id : INTEGER
    day_index : INTEGER
    {field} label : TEXT ("1일차 가슴·삼두")
  }
  class routine_item #FFF2CC {
    id : INTEGER
    routine_day_id : INTEGER
    sort_order : INTEGER
    exercise_id : INTEGER
    target_id : INTEGER NULL
    sets : INTEGER
    reps_min, reps_max : INTEGER
    technique : TEXT NULL
    note : TEXT
  }
  class routine_share #FFF2CC {
    id : INTEGER
    routine_id : INTEGER
    from_user_id : INTEGER
    {field} to_user_id : INTEGER NULL (친구 직접 공유)
    {field} share_code : TEXT NULL UNIQUE (비친구용)
    status : sent | saved | revoked
    created_at : TEXT
  }
  class recommendation_log #FFF2CC {
    id : INTEGER
    user_id : INTEGER
    tokens_in, tokens_out : INTEGER
    saved_routine_id : INTEGER NULL
    created_at : TEXT
  }
}

user "1" -- "0..*" routine : owner_id
routine "1" *-- "1..*" routine_day
routine_day "1" *-- "1..*" routine_item
routine_item "0..*" -- "1" exercise
routine_item "0..*" -- "0..1" muscle_group : target_id
routine "0..*" --> "0..1" routine : origin_routine_id\n(공유 복사본의 출처)
routine "1" -- "0..*" routine_share
user "1" -- "0..*" routine_share : from_user_id
user "0..1" -- "0..*" routine_share : to_user_id
user "1" -- "0..*" recommendation_log
recommendation_log "0..*" -- "0..1" routine : saved_routine_id
workout_session "0..*" -- "0..1" routine : routine_id\n(루틴으로 시작한 세션)
friendship .. routine_share : 친구 직접 공유는\nstatus=accepted 관계가 전제

note bottom of routine_share
  공유는 참조가 아니라 복사다.
  받는 쪽이 저장하면 routine 행이 새로 생기고
  origin_routine_id 로 출처만 남긴다.
  원본을 고쳐도 복사본은 바뀌지 않는다.
end note

note bottom of recommendation_log
  대화 원문·초안은 저장하지 않는다.
  비용·건수(월 쿼터)와 저장 여부만 남긴다.
end note
@enduml
